  <main id="main">

    <section class="page-head industry-head">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">Examples</span>
        <h1>Pick the work that slows your team down. <em>Watch AI do it.</em></h1>
        <p class="lead hero__say">Start with one of your own emails, then watch AI work through a morning&rsquo;s pile. Each shows what comes in, what AI does, and what a person still checks.</p>
        <p class="small muted aid-note">The examples use sample work, so play freely.</p>
        <nav class="aid-nav" aria-label="Jump to an example">
          <a href="#try">Your own email</a>
          <a href="#live">Watch it work</a>
          <a href="#calls">Missed calls</a>
          <a href="#qa">The same questions</a>
          <a href="#meeting">Meeting notes</a>
          <a href="#more">More examples</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 0. TRY IT ON YOUR OWN EMAIL (live AI, functions/assistant draft mode) -->
    <section class="section section--tint aid-sec" id="try" aria-labelledby="tryTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="aid-head reveal">
          <div><span class="eyebrow">Try it yourself</span><h2 id="tryTitle">Paste one of your own customer emails. See the reply AI would write.</h2></div>
          <dl class="aid-psr"><dt>Good for</dt><dd>Seeing it on your real work, not ours.</dd><dt>Limits</dt><dd>It doesn&rsquo;t know your prices, dates or policies yet, so it leaves gaps for you to fill. That&rsquo;s the part a person checks. Set up for you, it learns them.</dd></dl>
        </div>
        <ol class="aid-flow reveal" aria-label="How it works"><li><b>Comes in</b>Your customer&rsquo;s email</li><li><b>AI</b>reads it and drafts the reply</li><li><b>Ready for you</b>A reply, with the gaps marked</li><li><b>You</b>fill in the gaps and press send</li></ol>
        <div class="aid try reveal" data-try>
          <div class="aid__bar"><span class="aid__tag aid__tag--live">Live AI</span><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" data-try-sample>Use a sample email</button></div>
          <form class="form try__form" data-try-form novalidate>
            <div class="form-row">
              <label for="tryEmail">A customer email</label>
              <textarea id="tryEmail" name="email" rows="7" maxlength="3000" required placeholder="Paste an email a customer sent you"></textarea>
              <p class="form__hint">Take out names, phone numbers and account details first. We don&rsquo;t keep what you paste.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="form-row">
              <label for="tryBiz">What does your business do? <span class="optional">optional</span></label>
              <input id="tryBiz" name="business" type="text" maxlength="200" autocomplete="off" placeholder="e.g. Aircon installs and servicing in Pretoria" />
            </div>
            <div class="try__go"><button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary">Draft the reply</button><p class="small muted try__msg" data-try-msg aria-live="polite"></p></div>
          </form>
          <div class="try__out" data-try-out hidden>
            <p class="try__gist"><b>What they want:</b> <span data-try-gist></span></p>
            <div class="try__reply"><h4>The draft reply <small>ready for you</small></h4><div class="try__text" data-try-reply></div></div>
            <div class="try__check" data-try-checkbox><h4>You check before sending</h4><ul data-try-check></ul></div>
            <div class="try__acts"><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" data-try-copy>Copy the reply</button><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" data-try-again>Try another email</button></div>
            <p class="try__next">Want this on every email, with your prices and policies filled in? <a class="inline-link" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-try-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WATCH AI WORK (live-demo.html samples; these replace the old retyping and document examples) -->
    <section class="section aid-sec" id="live" aria-labelledby="liveTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="aid-head reveal">
          <div><span class="eyebrow">Watch it work</span><h2 id="liveTitle">A morning&rsquo;s work, done while you watch.</h2></div>
          <dl class="aid-psr"><dt>Good for</dt><dd>Seeing what it does with a whole pile of work, and the time it gives back.</dd><dt>Limits</dt><dd>These run on sample work. Ask us and we&rsquo;ll set one up with your own mix, usually the same day.</dd></dl>
        </div>
        <div class="aid-live reveal">
          <a class="aid-live__card" href="live-demo?sample=email" data-k="email" data-track="live-sample-email"><span class="alp alp--mail" aria-hidden="true"><span><i class="u"></i><b>Thandi Mokoena</b><em>Service for 3 aircons</em><s class="ok">Reply drafted</s></span><span><i></i><b>Grace van Wyk +4</b><em>RE: RE: RE: Midrand</em><s class="info">Summarised</s></span></span><span class="aid-live__top"><span class="aid-live__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 6h18v12H3z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg></span><span class="eyebrow">Email</span></span><h3>An inbox that sorts and answers itself</h3><p>Replies drafted, mail forwarded and filed, long threads summarised, urgent ones flagged.</p><span class="aid-live__go">Run it &rarr;</span></a>
          <a class="aid-live__card" id="systems" href="live-demo?sample=invoices" data-k="invoices" data-track="live-sample-invoices"><span class="alp alp--paper" aria-hidden="true"><span><s class="pdf">PDF</s><b>Steel Masters</b><em>R4,278.00</em><s class="stamp">Mismatch</s></span><span><s class="pdf">PDF</s><b>PaintPro</b><em>R52,900.00</em><s class="stamp ok">Posted</s></span></span><span class="aid-live__top"><span class="aid-live__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h9l3 3v15l-2-1.3-2 1.3-2-1.3-2 1.3-2-1.3L6 21z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 9h6M9 13h6M9 17h3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg></span><span class="eyebrow">Retyping documents</span></span><h3>Supplier invoices captured, no retyping</h3><p>Amounts and fields read, matched to the order, duplicates and odd amounts caught.</p><span class="aid-live__go">Run it &rarr;</span></a>
          <a class="aid-live__card" href="live-demo?sample=enquiries" data-k="enquiries" data-track="live-sample-enquiries"><span class="alp alp--chat" aria-hidden="true"><span class="in">Saturday morning for nails?</span><span class="out">Yes! 9:00 or 11:30? <i>✓✓</i></span></span><span class="aid-live__top"><span class="aid-live__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M8 10h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg></span><span class="eyebrow">Enquiries</span></span><h3>Every enquiry answered in minutes</h3><p>Prices answered, bookings offered, bigger jobs passed to the right person, day or night.</p><span class="aid-live__go">Run it &rarr;</span></a>
          <a class="aid-live__card" href="live-demo?sample=reviews" data-k="reviews" data-track="live-sample-reviews"><span class="alp alp--rev" aria-hidden="true"><span><b class="st">★★★★★</b> Johan V.</span><span class="rep">Thank you, Johan! See you soon.</span></span><span class="aid-live__top"><span class="aid-live__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3 2.7 5.6 6.1.9-4.4 4.3 1 6.1L12 17l-5.4 2.9 1-6.1L3.2 9.5l6.1-.9z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="eyebrow">Reviews</span></span><h3>Every review answered, complaints caught early</h3><p>Thank-yous and replies drafted, complaints flagged to the manager, recurring themes spotted.</p><span class="aid-live__go">Run it &rarr;</span></a>
          <a class="aid-live__card" id="rag" href="live-demo?sample=questions" data-k="questions" data-track="live-sample-questions"><span class="alp alp--slack" aria-hidden="true"><span class="ch"># ask-the-office</span><span><b>Zodwa</b> Leave for a family funeral?</span><span class="src">📄 Leave policy, section 4</span></span><span class="aid-live__top"><span class="aid-live__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 4h14v12h-6l-4 4v-4H5z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M10 8.5a2 2 0 1 1 2.6 1.9c-.4.2-.6.5-.6.9V12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg></span><span class="eyebrow">Finding answers</span></span><h3>Staff questions answered from your own documents</h3><p>Each answer shows which document it came from, and it says honestly when it doesn&rsquo;t know.</p><span class="aid-live__go">Run it &rarr;</span></a>
          <a class="aid-live__card" href="live-demo?sample=calls" data-k="calls" data-track="live-sample-calls"><span class="alp alp--calls" aria-hidden="true"><span><i>✆</i><b>Johan Pretorius</b><em>23:12</em><s class="hot">Emergency</s></span><span><i>✆</i><b>Nomvula Dlamini</b><em>07:48</em><s class="ok">Booked + SMS</s></span></span><span class="aid-live__top"><span class="aid-live__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6.5 3h3l1.5 4.5-2 1.5a11 11 0 0 0 6 6l1.5-2L21 14.5v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A16 16 0 0 1 4.5 5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="eyebrow">Phone calls</span></span><h3>Every call answered, even at 11pm</h3><p>Jobs booked with an SMS confirmation, emergencies sent to the on-call person, messages taken, big leads passed on.</p><span class="aid-live__go">Run it &rarr;</span></a>
          <a class="aid-live__card" href="live-demo?sample=meetings" data-k="meetings" data-track="live-sample-meetings"><span class="alp alp--mt" aria-hidden="true"><span><em>04:12</em><b>Thandi</b><q>Then we hire one for the Thursday run.</q><s class="ok">Decision</s></span><span><em>04:30</em><b>Pieter</b><q>I&rsquo;ll book it today.</q><s class="info">To-do: Pieter</s></span></span><span class="aid-live__top"><span class="aid-live__ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="m15 10 6-3v10l-6-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="eyebrow">Meetings</span></span><h3>Meeting notes and to-dos, before the meeting ends</h3><p>Decisions, who does what by when, risks to watch, and the follow-up email drafted from what was agreed.</p><span class="aid-live__go">Run it &rarr;</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 1. CALL TAKER -->
    <section class="section section--tint aid-sec" id="calls" aria-labelledby="callTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="aid-head reveal">
          <div><span class="eyebrow">01 · Missed calls</span><h2 id="callTitle">Every call answered, and the job written up while they talk.</h2></div>
          <dl class="aid-psr"><dt>Good for</dt><dd>Trades, practices and services that miss calls after hours or at busy times.</dd><dt>Limits</dt><dd>Hands complicated or upset callers to a person; it books into the slots you allow and never quotes prices you haven&rsquo;t given it.</dd></dl>
        </div>
        <ol class="aid-flow reveal" aria-label="How it works"><li><b>Comes in</b>A phone call</li><li><b>AI</b>answers, asks the right questions, fills in the job card</li><li><b>Ready for you</b>The job, ready to go</li><li><b>You</b>You call back to confirm, or the on-call person does</li></ol>
        <div class="aid reveal" data-aidemo="call">
          <div class="aid__bar"><span class="aid__tag">Sample data</span>
            <div class="aid__picks" role="group" aria-label="Pick a call"><button type="button" data-call-pick="plumber" aria-pressed="true">Emergency, 23:12</button><button type="button" data-call-pick="dental" aria-pressed="false">Booking, busy morning</button></div>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--small" data-call-play>Take the call</button>
          </div>
          <div class="call">
            <div class="call__phone">
              <div class="call__top"><span class="call__ring" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><b data-call-biz></b><small>Incoming call · <span data-call-time></span></small></div></div>
              <ol class="call__log" data-call-log aria-live="polite"></ol>
            </div>
            <div class="call__ticket">
              <h4>Job card <small>filled in live</small></h4>
              <div class="call__fields" data-call-ticket></div>
              <ul class="call__out" data-call-out hidden></ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. Q&AMP;A AND FAQ -->
    <section class="section aid-sec" id="qa" aria-labelledby="qaTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="aid-head reveal">
          <div><span class="eyebrow">02 · The same questions</span><h2 id="qaTitle">This one is live. Ask it anything about us.</h2></div>
          <dl class="aid-psr"><dt>Good for</dt><dd>Any business answering the same questions by email, chat and WhatsApp.</dd><dt>Limits</dt><dd>Only as good as the information it&rsquo;s given; it says when it doesn&rsquo;t know and passes the person on.</dd></dl>
        </div>
        <ol class="aid-flow reveal" aria-label="How it works"><li><b>Comes in</b>A customer&rsquo;s question</li><li><b>AI</b>answers from your own information</li><li><b>Ready for you</b>A clear answer, any time of day</li><li><b>You</b>Anything it can&rsquo;t answer comes to you</li></ol>
        <div class="aid aid--narrow reveal">
          <div class="aid__bar"><span class="aid__tag aid__tag--live">Live AI</span><span class="aid__hint">Answers only from our real pricing and method, and says when it doesn&rsquo;t know.</span></div>
          <div class="asst" data-assistant>
            <div class="asst__log" aria-live="polite" aria-label="Conversation">
              <div class="asst__msg asst__msg--ai">Hi! I'm Re-Charge's own AI assistant. Ask me about how Re-Charge works, what it costs, or how results are measured.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="asst__chips">
              <button type="button">What does it cost?</button>
              <button type="button">How do you measure the time saved?</button>
              <button type="button">How does it start?</button>
              <button type="button">Can you guarantee results?</button>
            </div>
            <form class="asst__form">
              <label class="sr-only" for="asstIn2">Ask a question</label>
              <input class="asst__input" id="asstIn2" type="text" maxlength="500" placeholder="Ask about the method, pricing or results…" autocomplete="off" />
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary asst__send">Ask</button>
            </form>
            <p class="asst__note">Real AI, answering from Re-Charge's own information. It can be wrong; for anything important, check with us on WhatsApp.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 6. MEETING NOTES -->
    <section class="section section--tint aid-sec" id="meeting" aria-labelledby="mtTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="aid-head reveal">
          <div><span class="eyebrow">03 · Meeting notes</span><h2 id="mtTitle">Notes and to-dos, before the meeting ends.</h2></div>
          <dl class="aid-psr"><dt>Good for</dt><dd>Teams with regular meetings, client calls or site visits.</dd><dt>Limits</dt><dd>Needs everyone&rsquo;s consent to record; strong accents and crosstalk reduce accuracy, so someone checks the notes before they go out.</dd></dl>
        </div>
        <ol class="aid-flow reveal" aria-label="How it works"><li><b>Comes in</b>Your meeting</li><li><b>AI</b>listens and writes it up</li><li><b>Ready for you</b>Decisions and who does what, by when</li><li><b>You</b>You read it before it goes out</li></ol>
        <div class="aid reveal" data-aidemo="meeting">
          <div class="aid__bar"><span class="aid__tag">Sample data</span>
            <div class="aid__picks" role="group" aria-label="Pick a meeting"><button type="button" data-mt-pick="ops" aria-pressed="true">Weekly ops</button><button type="button" data-mt-pick="sales" aria-pressed="false">Sales call</button></div>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" data-mt-speed aria-label="Playback speed">1×</button>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--small" data-mt-play>Play</button>
          </div>
          <div class="mt">
            <div class="mt__live">
              <div class="mt__head"><span class="mt__rec" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><b data-mt-title></b><small data-mt-meta></small></div></div>
              <div class="mt__prog" aria-hidden="true"><i data-mt-bar></i></div>
              <ol class="mt__tx" data-mt-transcript aria-live="polite"></ol>
            </div>
            <div class="mt__notes" data-mt-notes aria-live="polite"></div>
          </div>
          <p class="aid__foot" data-mt-done hidden>Notes ready the moment the call ends, emailed to everyone who attended, with each action linked to the moment it was agreed. Click any item above to see where it came from.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MORE EXAMPLES (folded) -->
    <section class="section aid-sec aid-more-sec" id="more" aria-labelledby="moreTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <details class="aid-more" data-aid-more>
          <summary><span class="eyebrow">More examples</span><h2 id="moreTitle">Following up customers, reading feedback, writing posts.</h2><span class="aid-more__btn" aria-hidden="true">Show</span></summary>
    <!-- 5. AI SALES PIPELINE -->
      <div class="aid-sec aid-sec--more" id="crm" aria-labelledby="crmTitle">
        <div>
          <div class="aid-head reveal">
            <div><span class="eyebrow">Chasing customers</span><h2 id="crmTitle">It tells you which customers have gone quiet, and writes the follow-up.</h2></div>
            <dl class="aid-psr"><dt>Good for</dt><dd>Anyone with more quotes out than they can keep track of.</dd><dt>Limits</dt><dd>It only sees what&rsquo;s in your email, calls and CRM, and a person sends every follow-up.</dd></dl>
          </div>
          <div class="aid reveal" data-aidemo="crm">
            <div class="aid__bar"><span class="aid__tag">Sample data</span><span class="aid__hint">Six open quotes for a sample business.</span><button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--small" data-crm-run>Who needs a follow-up?</button></div>
            <div class="crm-sum" data-crm-sum hidden></div>
            <div class="crm">
              <div class="crm-board" data-crm-board></div>
              <aside class="crm-side" data-crm-side aria-live="polite"><p class="tiny muted">Press &ldquo;Who needs a follow-up?&rdquo;, or pick a customer.</p></aside>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
  
      <!-- 7. CUSTOMER INSIGHT -->
      <div class="aid-sec aid-sec--more" id="insight" aria-labelledby="inTitle">
        <div>
          <div class="aid-head reveal">
            <div><span class="eyebrow">Customer feedback</span><h2 id="inTitle">What are customers saying? Ask, and see their actual words.</h2></div>
            <dl class="aid-psr"><dt>Good for</dt><dd>Businesses with lots of reviews, surveys or support tickets.</dd><dt>Limits</dt><dd>It summarises what customers said; it can&rsquo;t tell you what customers who never commented think.</dd></dl>
          </div>
          <div class="aid reveal" data-aidemo="insight">
            <div class="aid__bar"><span class="aid__tag">Sample data</span><span class="aid__hint">Bean There Coffee Co. · <span data-in-count></span></span>
              <label class="aid__sel">Customers <select data-in-seg aria-label="Customer group"></select></label>
            </div>
            <div class="in">
              <div class="in__themes"><h4>What they talk about <small>click one</small></h4><ul data-in-themes></ul><div class="in__quotes" data-in-quotes aria-live="polite"></div></div>
              <div class="in__rep">
                <h4>Ask your customers</h4>
                <div class="in__asks"><button type="button" data-in-ask="more">What would make you come more often?</button><button type="button" data-in-ask="annoy">What annoys you most?</button><button type="button" data-in-ask="love">What do you love about us?</button><button type="button" data-in-ask="leave">Why would you go somewhere else?</button></div>
                <form class="in__free" data-in-free><label class="sr-only" for="inQ">Your question</label><input id="inQ" name="q" type="text" maxlength="120" placeholder="Or ask your own question…" /><button type="submit" class="btn btn--ghost btn--small">Ask</button></form>
                <div class="in__answer" data-in-answer aria-live="polite"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
  
      <!-- 8. CONTENT CREATOR -->
      <div class="aid-sec aid-sec--more" id="content" aria-labelledby="ccTitle">
        <div>
          <div class="aid-head reveal">
            <div><span class="eyebrow">Writing posts</span><h2 id="ccTitle">On-brand posts and emails, from one line of direction.</h2></div>
            <dl class="aid-psr"><dt>Good for</dt><dd>Owners who know they should post but never get to it.</dd><dt>Limits</dt><dd>Drafts only: a person approves every post, and it needs your past posts and brand guide to sound like you.</dd></dl>
          </div>
          <div class="aid reveal" data-aidemo="content">
            <div class="aid__bar"><span class="aid__tag">Sample generator</span><span class="aid__hint">The real one learns your voice from your past posts and brand guide.</span></div>
            <div class="cc">
              <form class="cc__form" data-cc-form>
                <label>Business<input name="biz" type="text" maxlength="40" value="Atlas Office Supplies" /></label>
                <label>Post about<select name="kind"></select></label>
                <label><span data-cc-ask>What is it?</span><input name="detail" type="text" maxlength="120" /></label>
                <div class="cc__row">
                  <label>Channel<select name="channel"><option>LinkedIn</option><option>Instagram</option><option>Facebook</option><option>Email</option></select></label>
                  <label>Tone<select name="tone"><option>Professional</option><option>Friendly</option><option>Bold</option></select></label>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary">Write it</button>
              </form>
              <div class="cc__out">
                <div class="cc-post" data-cc-post data-ch="LinkedIn">
                  <div class="cc-post__head"><span class="cc-post__ava" data-cc-ava aria-hidden="true">A</span><span><b data-cc-biz>Atlas Office Supplies</b><small data-cc-meta>LinkedIn · Draft</small></span></div>
                  <pre class="cc__text" data-cc-out aria-live="polite">Pick what to post about, then press Write it.</pre>
                  <div class="cc-post__foot" aria-hidden="true" data-cc-foot><span>👍 Like</span><span>💬 Comment</span><span>↻ Repost</span><span>➤ Send</span></div>
                </div>
                <ul class="cc__checks" data-cc-checks></ul>
                <div class="btn-row"><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" data-cc-again>Another version</button><button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" data-cc-copy>Copy</button></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
  
          </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 9. WEBSITE & TOOL EXAMPLES -->
    <section class="section section--tint aid-sec" id="tools" aria-labelledby="toolsTitle">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="aid-head reveal">
          <div><span class="eyebrow">Not everything needs AI</span><h2 id="toolsTitle">Websites, calculators and dashboards.</h2></div>
          <p class="small muted">Often the practical answer is simpler. These run too, built for fictional businesses.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ex-grid">
          <article class="ex-card reveal"><span class="ex-card__k">Quotes</span><h3>Instant quote calculator</h3><dl><dt>The problem</dt><dd>Every quote is worked out by hand and sent hours later.</dd><dt>What it does</dt><dd>Customers price the job themselves and send it to your WhatsApp.</dd></dl><a class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" href="demos#quote-calculator" data-track="demo-open-quote">Try it &rarr;</a></article>
          <article class="ex-card reveal"><span class="ex-card__k">Numbers</span><h3>Sales dashboard</h3><dl><dt>The problem</dt><dd>Sales live in spreadsheets nobody has time to read.</dd><dt>What it does</dt><dd>One screen: revenue, orders and top products, filtered in a click.</dd></dl><a class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" href="demos#sales-dashboard" data-track="demo-open-dashboard">Try it &rarr;</a></article>
          <article class="ex-card reveal"><span class="ex-card__k">Bookings</span><h3>Online booking</h3><dl><dt>The problem</dt><dd>Bookings happen by phone tag and get double-booked.</dd><dt>What it does</dt><dd>Customers pick a free slot and confirm in seconds.</dd></dl><a class="btn btn--ghost btn--small" href="demos#booking" data-track="demo-open-booking">Try it &rarr;</a></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
      <div class="container cta__inner reveal">
        <span class="cta__services">Calls · Emails · Documents · Questions · Meetings</span>
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">Seen something like your problem?</h2>
        <p>Tell us about it in your own words. We&rsquo;ll suggest the practical version for your business, and what it would cost.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a class="btn btn--light btn--large" href="https://calendar.app.google/58FYamh1ahXB4khM9" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-track="cta-examples-book">Book a free 30-minute call</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="callwhat" aria-label="What happens on the free call"><li>You tell us about the work</li><li>We say honestly if AI fits</li><li>No slides, no pitch</li><li>You leave with a rough price, or an honest &ldquo;not worth it&rdquo;</li></ul>
        <p class="cta__alt">Prefer to write? <button type="button" class="inline-link" data-review-open>Tell us in a few lines</button></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
